<http://data.silknow.org/event/7a176f51-47a6-3ac7-a090-8bdbbf224698>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "This apron was part of a wedding outfit worn by the bride at a peasant wedding in the district between Quimperlé and Pont-Aven, Finistère.\n\nPurchased (16 to 20-1902, £25). Registered File number 36225/1901. See also RP 90589/1901, (file) RP 2353/1902."@en ;
